{
  "_comment": "Single source of truth for the corpus contract shared by the ai-backend and ingestion packages. The two are INDEPENDENT Python packages (neither imports the other); this file is the only thing they share, and each Docker image copies it in. Edit here, never in one package only. Parity tests in both suites fail if a package's code drifts from it.",
  "version": 1,
  "embedding": {
    "_comment": "Defaults matching the deployed corpus. EMBEDDING_PROVIDER / EMBEDDING_MODEL / EMBEDDING_DIM still override per deployment; check_fingerprint() raises if a reader disagrees with what the writer stored.",
